OL,3,AOil, gas and borrowing costs surge as
OL,4,Afears over Middle East escalate
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe price of oil has jumped to $105 a
OL,7,Fbarrel amid signs the conflict in the
OL,8,FMiddle East will not be resolved
OL,9,Fquickly, fuelling fears that inflation
OL,10,Fcould accelerate.
OL,12,FWith the conflict between the US and
OL,13,FIran in the Gulf intensifying in recent
OL,14,Fdays, the cost of both crude oil and
OL,15,Fgas has been rising sharply. Brent
OL,16,Fcrude went back above $100 a barrel on
OL,17,FWednesday and has continued to climb.
OL,19,FThe war has led to the effective
OL,20,Fclosure of the Strait of Hormuz,
OL,21,Fpreventing supplies of oil and gas from
OL,22,Fthe Gulf from reaching global markets.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,119,105,200,300,0,100
